## Interface: 16001
## Title: Clean Bow Gun Sounds
## Notes: Mutes the bow pullback, can play the cleaner bow release in place of the looser one, and mutes any other shot sound you tick.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 2.0.0
## Category: Audio
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Weapon_Bow_05
## SavedVariables: CleanBowGunSoundsDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: CleanBowGunSounds_CompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: CleanBowGunSounds_CompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: CleanBowGunSounds_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Sounds owns the sound list, the saved settings and the muting,
# Release plays the swapped bow release on your own shots, and Options builds the settings panel, the
# slash command and the addon-menu entry on top of both.

Core\Sounds.lua
Core\Release.lua
UI\Options.lua
